[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m So rows **R1–R4** record that the four generic C-API rejection classes are
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m *structurally absent*, and rows **E1–E12** are the real, reachable degenerate /
