[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    71[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### Why E7–E11 are prefix-compared
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    72[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    73[0m:[38;5;10m[49m These five inputs each emit between 23 GB and 45 GB of text and require between
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    74[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 2.1e9 and 4.3e9 `printf` calls. Running either library to completion exceeds the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    75[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 600 s command budget by a wide margin. The differential test therefore launches
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    76[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the C and the Rust `.so` in **separate child processes** writing to a pipe,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    77[0m:[38;5;10m[49m compares a bounded **prefix** of the byte streams (which covers the interesting
