[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    80[0m:[38;5;10m[49m inside the budget, and then kills both. That is a real differential assertion
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    81[0m:[38;5;10m[49m about the UB path, not a skipped row.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    82[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
