[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m second call behave like the first).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The rows below are that cross-product, pruned to the combinations the code
