[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    280[0m:[38;5;10m[49m             "[C13/{i}] interleaving C/Rust for ({a},{b}) changed the byte stream"
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    281[0m:[38;5;10m[49m         );
